        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART I, LINE 2:</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>SCHOLARSHIP FUNDS ARE PROVIDED THROUGH DONATIONS FROM FACULTY, STAFF, RETIREES, ALUMNI AND COMMUNITY AND BUSINESS LEADERS. STUDENTS APPLY FOR SCHOLARSHIPS RELEVANT TO THEIR ACADEMIC MAJOR, CAREER OBJECTIVE OR INDIVIDUAL INTEREST. SCHOLARSHIPS ARE PROVIDED TO STUDENTS WHO QUALIFY AND ARE AWARDED BASED ON DONOR'S INTENTION AT THE TIME THE CONTRIBUTION TOWARD THE SCHOLARSHIPS FUND ARE MADE.</ExplanationTxt>
